		"name": "Distributed Real-Time E-Commerce Platform (v1)",
		"description": "Postman collection for the Distributed Real-Time E-Commerce Platform API v1.\n\nBase URL: http://localhost:8000\n\nSeeded accounts (php artisan db:seed):\n- admin@example.com / password (admin)\n- customer@example.com / password (customer)\n\nEvery request has tests. Run the collection top to bottom: the Auth folder stores {{token}} (customer) and {{admin_token}}, sentinel variables used by the other folders.\n\nRequirement 2 (warehouse gRPC) folder notes:\n- Items 1, 2, 2a, 2b, 2c, 3 run automatically against the live Go warehouse service.\n- Item 4 (warehouse down) is skipped unless {{run_warehouse_down}} = true. To run it: `docker compose stop warehouse`, set the variable to true, send the request, then `docker compose start warehouse`.\n- Item 5 (after the race) is skipped unless {{run_race}} = true. Run `scripts/proof/race-condition.ps1` first, then send it.\n\nNo request in this collection is left without a test.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
